              under the modular group action
              %a.maruku-eqref{:href => "#eq:SymplecticActonOnSecondIntegerHeisenberg"} (11)
              on the Heisenberg group, in that:
            #eq:SemidirectProductRelations.maruku-equation
              %span.maruku-eq-number (15)
