              %a.maruku-eqref{:href => "#eq:PresentationOfSL2Z"} (13)
              are satisfied:
            %p First we find
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
